#: processes/ci-health-watch.bpmn:26
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Named a 'sweep' but every path through it writes something — the report file, the tracking label, and the issue itself (opened, edited or closed) — and keeping all three in one lane is what makes 'one tracking issue, edited in place' enforceable: a write split across lanes would leave two different actors able to touch the same issue with no ordering between them."
